      "value": "I have also found that in 3-point index-controllers don't move shoulder bones but other controllers do. \nIn fullbody shoulder bones don't seem to move regardless of controller type, but there are various subtle differences to IK all over.\nAs a sidenote I much prefer that with avatars with short arms that it pulls the arms and back forward rather than avatar and real hands getting disconnected like it does in 3-point.",
