  "details": "Heres a simple info graphic that explains it but ill explain it here as well. If i use my 2018 Vive wands my arm length is correct and matches my avatars perfectly, i can fully extend my arms and my avatar does the same with no issues. If i use my Valve Index Controllers my IRL arms Become way to long for my avatar and it pulls my avatars head and shoulders forward infront of my viewpoint whenever i extend my arms forward. The red circle on the right side indicates where my head is irl when im standing straight up and arms straight out forward. I like my index controllers but if its gonna do this to my avatar then imma stick with the vive wands",
